    {
      "id": 392086,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "Response manipulation was discovered on the Enjin platform. It is a vulnerability that allows an attacker to manipulate the response to a specific request. Using the victim's email address, the attacker can register without the victim's permission and log in without verifying the email address.",
